SOLUTION 0  Infilling solution
    units mol/kgw
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10  Initial solution in cells
    units mol/kgw
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    -equilibrate 1
    X 0.001

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -lengths 1.0
    -boundary_conditions flux flux

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file mol_real_pe.sel
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -step
    -solution
    -pe

END
